.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B GetConfigPerFile
When \fItrue\fP the check will look for the configuration for where an
identifier is declared. Useful for when included header files use a
different style.
Default value is \fItrue\fP\&.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
