.sp
.sp
The Doxygen documentation describes the \fBinternal\fP software that makes up the
tools of clang\-tools\-extra, not the \fBexternal\fP use of these tools. The Doxygen
documentation contains no instructions about how to use the tools, only the APIs
that make up the software. For usage instructions, please see the user\(aqs guide
or reference manual for each tool.
